Z||000000||88formula||10-24-1999||07:01 PM||||My 87 four cylinder only averages 21 miles to the gallon and that is mostly highway miles. It had a major tuneup including a new O2 sensor and it only inproved a little. The car runs fine except sometimes it wants to stall in the morning when its cold. I always here of people getting much better mileage than I do, are they lying or is there something wrong with my fiero. Im not a leadfoot driver.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cooter||10-24-1999||07:06 PM||||If you have the automatic, you might not get as good of mileage as the five speed. My 85 with the 5 sp. gets about 25 mpg in town and 30+ on the highway. ||||reg||1
